@HimLedger.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5228
@token = replace-with-a-valid-bearer-token
@claimId = 1

### API health
GET {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain

### Create a draft claim
POST {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "title": "Client travel",
  "description": "Taxi to a customer meeting",
  "amount": 245.50,
  "expenseDate": "2026-10-02T00:00:00Z"
}

### List claims with reconciliation filters
GET {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Expenses?status=Pending%20Approval&fromDate=2026-10-01&toDate=2026-12-31&departmentId=1&categoryId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload a PDF/JPEG/PNG receipt as multipart form data
POST {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Expenses/{{claimId}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=HimLedgerBoundary

--HimLedgerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="receipt.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./receipt.pdf
--HimLedgerBoundary--

### Get a five-minute read-only receipt SAS URL
GET {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Expenses/{{claimId}}/attachments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit a draft (then automatically routes it to Pending Approval)
POST {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Expenses/{{claimId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Ready for review"
}

### View lifecycle history
GET {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Expenses/{{claimId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Review: approve, reject, or request changes
PUT {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Expenses/{{claimId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Changes Requested",
  "comments": "Please provide the business purpose.",
  "rowVersion": "AAAAAAAAAAA="
}

### Resubmit after changes are made
POST {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Expenses/{{claimId}}/resubmit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Added the business purpose."
}

### Record reimbursement (Finance/Admin)
POST {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Expenses/{{claimId}}/reimburse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Paid in payroll batch 2026-10"
}

### Detect possible duplicate submissions (Manager/Admin/Finance)
GET {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Expenses/{{claimId}}/duplicates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reconciliation export with optional period, department, and category filters
GET {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Expenses/reconciliation.csv?fromDate=2026-10-01&toDate=2026-12-31&departmentId=1&categoryId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delegate approvals to another department user for a limited period
POST {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ApprovalDelegations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delegateUserId": 2,
  "startsAt": "2026-10-02T00:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-10-09T00:00:00Z"
}

### Read a delegation created by this manager
GET {{HimLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ApprovalDelegations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
